sequenceDiagram
  participant Acc as Accountant
  participant Web as Web app
  participant API
  participant C as CommissionService
  participant PG as PostgreSQL
  Acc->>Web: Invoice detail, Edit, change lines, type a reason
  Web->>API: POST /invoices/:id/edit/preview
  API->>PG: apply the edit in a transaction, then roll it back
  API-->>Web: preview of totals and money released
  Acc->>Web: Save changes
  Web->>API: POST /invoices/:id/edit with expectedRevision
  API->>PG: revision plus 1, allocations released, ledger INVOICE_ADJUSTED, audit EDITED
  API->>C: recordForCharges, source CHARGE_ADJUST
  C->>PG: signed commission entries
  alt Give the freed money back
    Acc->>Web: Refund, or Save and refund
    Web->>API: POST /invoices/:id/refund
    API->>PG: refund RFD, refund sources, ledger REFUND, audit REFUNDED
  else Cancel an unpaid invoice
    Acc->>Web: Cancel, type a reason
    Web->>API: POST /invoices/:id/cancel
    API->>PG: status CANCELLED, charges back to not invoiced, ledger INVOICE_CANCELLED
  else Cancel a paid invoice - API only
    Acc->>API: POST /payments/:id/unapply
    API->>PG: negative allocations, money back to advance
    API->>C: recordForCharges, source UNAPPLY
  end
